# env.optional — fallbacks only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify fallback if the OPTIONAL competitor Meta Ad Library pass is blocked. If set ->
# Apify actor; else -> the keyless Playwright scraper, degrading to `site:` web search
# (default):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Optional SERP upgrade for the audience/interest research queries. If a DataForSEO (or
# Serper) key is set -> structured SERP API; else -> the agent's keyless web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Proxy for the competitor scrape / research (Robomotion Proxy):
HTTPS_PROXY
